:: Girl invite - include [include]

/* An 'invite her'-button
    Random event - meet girl #3 → NPC view
        $wasRaped
    Car explore - meet person → NPC view
    Explore event: Abandoned mall
        $strangerMeeting.gaveFood
    The chance comes from setup.player.inviteChance: relationship, reputation, companions, and the dice rolled
    when meeting a stranger (setup.player.meetStranger, shown by <<strangerMeetText>>). setup.player.rollInvite
    rolls it (a yes uses up $strangerMeeting); <<inviteAccept>> / <<inviteRefusal>> (widgets/npc/strangerMeet.tw)
    do the rest.
 */
 /*
    things to consider
    - current events
    - personal status: relationship, happpiness, sub ....
    - have she heard (rumours) of the hero? Good or bad? (done for good rumours: reputation, $strangerMeeting.heardOfYou)
    - do she know any of the companions? (a companion vouching: $strangerMeeting.companionVouched)
  */

 <<if ($tmpGirlInvite ?? false) && setup.guestRoom.hasRoom()>>
    <<set _linkName = 'Invite '  + setup.pronounceWho($tmpGirl) + ' as guest'>>
	<<linkreplace _linkName>>
        <<set $tmpGirlInvite = false>>
        <<set _yes = setup.player.rollInvite($tmpGirl, $wasRaped ?? false)>>
        <<unset $wasRaped>>
        <<if _yes>>
            <<inviteAccept $tmpGirl>>
        <<else>>
            <<inviteRefusal $tmpGirl `$player.strength <= $tmpGirl.strength`>>
        <</if>>
	<</linkreplace>>
<</if>>
